<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="ballot-head"><div class="bar"></div><div class="hairlines"></div></div>
<p class="eyebrow">Shown exactly once — the system keeps only a hash</p>
<h1>Verification link for <%= m.name %></h1>
<div class="notice warn">
  <strong>Deliver this link to the member yourself</strong> (SMTP is not configured, so it was not
  emailed automatically). Send it to <span class="mono"><%= m.email %></span> from your own mail
  account, or hand it to the member directly. It works exactly once, expires, and any earlier
  link for this member no longer works.
</div>
<p>Link to send:</p>
<p class="mono" style="word-break:break-all"><%= verifyUrl %></p>
<p class="sub">When the member opens the link, their address is marked verified and electronic
credentials can be issued to it. Members who never verify can still vote by paper ballot.</p>
<a class="btn primary" href="/admin/members">Done — I have delivered this link</a>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
